  "solution": "Concept Used:\n\nFollow the BODMAS rule according to the table given below:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d0dde522f65134a981f8db6f1ac5aebe5108510a68c758df909f765f209687bd.png] \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n7 + 5 - 2 × (7 + 89) - 94 ÷ 2 + (33 ÷ 3 + 9 × 2 - 7) ÷ 11.\n\n⇒ 7 + 5 – 2 × 96 – 94 ÷ 2 + (33 ÷ 3 + 9 × 2 – 7) ÷ 11\n\n⇒ 7 + 5 – 2 × 96 – 94 ÷ 2 + (11 + 18 – 7) ÷ 11\n\n⇒ 7 + 5 – 2 × 96 – 94 ÷ 2 + 22 ÷ 11\n\n⇒ 7 + 5 – 2 × 96 – 47 + 2\n\n⇒ 12 – 2 × 96 – 47 + 2\n\n⇒ 12 – 192 – 47 + 2\n\n⇒ – 180 – 47 + 2\n\n⇒ – 227 + 2\n\n⇒ – 225\n\n**∴ The value is -225**",
